physicalRef: topup/database
description: "Telecom revenue assurance Link Analysis showcase - One row per prepaid top-up: subscriber, amount, when, the channel (retail, app or card) and, for a retail top-up, the point of sale. One file per month topped up (TOPUP_YYYYMM.csv); the next month is in data/staged. Landed by the topup Pipeline. Synthetic."
eventDate: topped_up_at
columns[5]{name,type,classification}:
  msisdn,string,
  amount,number,
  topped_up_at,timestamp,
  channel,string,
  pos_id,string,
